(733238, 78902, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a beautiful model. I like the dramatic lighting. But the glossy sparkles are overdone. I like the ones on her lips, but not in the hair, they look out of place. The catch-lights in her eyes also seem exagerated.</td>', 'Great idea and a beautiful model. I like the dramatic lighting. But the glossy sparkles are overdone. I like the ones on her lips, but not in the hair, they look out of place. The catch-lights in her eyes also seem exagerated.', '2004-05-24 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
