(733557, 78900, 16488, '<td valign="top">But you do have the beginnings of a great banana bread . . . 1 point for bananas, 1 point for image tone, 1 point for cropping and composition, 1 point for being brave, and 1 more for your sense of humor.  (Hope a 5''s o.k. with you.)</td>', 'But you do have the beginnings of a great banana bread . . . 1 point for bananas, 1 point for image tone, 1 point for cropping and composition, 1 point for being brave, and 1 more for your sense of humor.  (Hope a 5''s o.k. with you.)', '2004-05-24 14:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(733563, 78417, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice idea - well done to show the "weight".  Wish the blinds (?) on the right weren''t at all visible.  I like the dramatic lighting.  I''d crop it in more on all sides - as is the space looks a bit random.</td>', 'nice idea - well done to show the "weight".  Wish the blinds (?) on the right weren''t at all visible.  I like the dramatic lighting.  I''d crop it in more on all sides - as is the space looks a bit random.', '2004-05-24 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(733571, 78867, 7628, '<td valign="top">fun combination of subjects.  The contrast between the bright yellow organic banana and the cold metal shapes makes a nice composition.  Wish there were a bit more order or meaning to the tools or less order.  This grouping seems to have a theme that just escapse me, it''s organized in this horizontal way, but with odd clumpings.  Maybe a larger pile of tools with no order... or perhaps a simple bunch of wrenches.</td>', 'fun combination of subjects.  The contrast between the bright yellow organic banana and the cold metal shapes makes a nice composition.  Wish there were a bit more order or meaning to the tools or less order.  This grouping seems to have a theme that just escapse me, it''s organized in this horizontal way, but with odd clumpings.  Maybe a larger pile of tools with no order... or perhaps a simple bunch of wrenches.', '2004-05-24 14:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(733576, 78513, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the close up - and the texture of the doggies mouth versus the smooth bananas.  Wish it were sharper and the lighting were less bright, glaring.</td>', 'I like the close up - and the texture of the doggies mouth versus the smooth bananas.  Wish it were sharper and the lighting were less bright, glaring.', '2004-05-24 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(733578, 78564, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but wish we could see more of the banana.  I do like the "V" shaped composition.</td>', 'I like the idea but wish we could see more of the banana.  I do like the "V" shaped composition.', '2004-05-24 14:14:03.000000', NULL, 1);
