(733720, 78487, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice natural portrait. They are really enjoying those bananas and each other''s company. I like the field of daffodiles echoing the yellow of the bananas (I had a similar idea in my entry). What hurts this phtoto is the flat lighting. The color is a bit washed out. The models all have very fair skin and their faces have been overexposed. There is good detail in the darks of her scarf and the foremost girl''s dark clothing but the lights are very lacking.</td>', 'Nice natural portrait. They are really enjoying those bananas and each other''s company. I like the field of daffodiles echoing the yellow of the bananas (I had a similar idea in my entry). What hurts this phtoto is the flat lighting. The color is a bit washed out. The models all have very fair skin and their faces have been overexposed. There is good detail in the darks of her scarf and the foremost girl''s dark clothing but the lights are very lacking.', '2004-05-24 15:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
