(733736, 78575, 16106, '<td valign="top">lovely light. one shot that records what a bananna is rather than plays with how you can dress it up. You captured the subtle textures very well. Best thus far.</td>', 'lovely light. one shot that records what a bananna is rather than plays with how you can dress it up. You captured the subtle textures very well. Best thus far.', '2004-05-24 15:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(733741, 78692, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait. I like that the boys don''t have shirts. It unifies the theme. I would have given it higher marks but I don''t care for the motion blur (it looks like you used slow flash sync as fill light). <br/>The foremost boy is too fuzzy. Also, you should take advantage of the maximum pixel size of 640 (I didn''t lower the score for it in this case).</td>', 'This is a nice portrait. I like that the boys don''t have shirts. It unifies the theme. I would have given it higher marks but I don''t care for the motion blur (it looks like you used slow flash sync as fill light). The foremost boy is too fuzzy. Also, you should take advantage of the maximum pixel size of 640 (I didn''t lower the score for it in this case).', '2004-05-24 15:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(733748, 78416, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid portrait. You''ve placed the subject in context and the stairs make an interesting background. It could have been cropped a little tighter on the left edge to eliminate at least one of the distracting white spots in the corner. The focus is not as sharp as I like but this could be a camera issue (I have that problem myself). I like it, overall.</td>', 'This is a nice candid portrait. You''ve placed the subject in context and the stairs make an interesting background. It could have been cropped a little tighter on the left edge to eliminate at least one of the distracting white spots in the corner. The focus is not as sharp as I like but this could be a camera issue (I have that problem myself). I like it, overall.', '2004-05-24 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(733750, 78654, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the color and shadow in this abstract. It''s perhaps a little fuzzy in the far right or maybe that section could be a bit darker?</td>', 'I like the color and shadow in this abstract. It''s perhaps a little fuzzy in the far right or maybe that section could be a bit darker?', '2004-05-24 15:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
