(733793, 78817, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this subject very interesting or visually appealing. I realize the title of your photo is "Lonely" but this would have worked better with more bananas filling the container. As it stands there is too much static black negative space. The vertical and curvey  lines of the the container don''t really break it up because the contrast isn''t strong enough. The lighting is very flat and boring.</td>', 'I don''t find this subject very interesting or visually appealing. I realize the title of your photo is "Lonely" but this would have worked better with more bananas filling the container. As it stands there is too much static black negative space. The vertical and curvey  lines of the the container don''t really break it up because the contrast isn''t strong enough. The lighting is very flat and boring.', '2004-05-24 15:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
