(733810, 78573, 16957, '<td valign="top">Good idea but it does not look authentic (guess that would be hard) but some things could be done to improve matters. Have the banana obviously having slid along the surface, choose a more realistic surface (e.g. pavement), have the foot in a more natural pose.... 6</td>', 'Good idea but it does not look authentic (guess that would be hard) but some things could be done to improve matters. Have the banana obviously having slid along the surface, choose a more realistic surface (e.g. pavement), have the foot in a more natural pose.... 6', '2004-05-24 15:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
