(733828, 78718, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m voting on this challenge (as I do all challenges) by first asking myself, does this photo have any appeal outside the boundaries of the challenge.  In other words, art comes first.  In this case I have to say, "no". The subject does not appeal to me as something I would want to look at again and again. Technically, the lighting is flat, lacking drama and detail. There is nowhere for the eye to rest.</td>', 'I''m voting on this challenge (as I do all challenges) by first asking myself, does this photo have any appeal outside the boundaries of the challenge.  In other words, art comes first.  In this case I have to say, "no". The subject does not appeal to me as something I would want to look at again and again. Technically, the lighting is flat, lacking drama and detail. There is nowhere for the eye to rest.', '2004-05-24 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(733836, 78648, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m voting on this challenge (as I do all challenges) by first asking myself, does this photo have any appeal outside the boundaries of the challenge.  In other words, art comes first.  In this case I have to say, \"no\". The subject does not appeal to me as something I would want to look at again and again. Truthfully, I find it unpleasant to look at. I don''t mind being made uncomfortable by a photo but this is just mundanely distasteful to me. There isn''t enough contrast between the background and the top edge of the banana, It nearly disappears into the background. The only details in the banana are in the lower edge where it is in shadow.</td>', 'I''m voting on this challenge (as I do all challenges) by first asking myself, does this photo have any appeal outside the boundaries of the challenge.  In other words, art comes first.  In this case I have to say, \"no\". The subject does not appeal to me as something I would want to look at again and again. Truthfully, I find it unpleasant to look at. I don''t mind being made uncomfortable by a photo but this is just mundanely distasteful to me. There isn''t enough contrast between the background and the top edge of the banana, It nearly disappears into the background. The only details in the banana are in the lower edge where it is in shadow.', '2004-05-24 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(733862, 78454, 327, '<td valign="top">Such a different composition, not sure I know what to make of it. The pitchers [the top is chopped off on the one to the right] are very nice and I like the tones. Still this is just odd looking. Not sure what your trying to show or say here.</td>', 'Such a different composition, not sure I know what to make of it. The pitchers [the top is chopped off on the one to the right] are very nice and I like the tones. Still this is just odd looking. Not sure what your trying to show or say here.', '2004-05-24 16:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(733863, 78637, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. I like the light and the soft focus. I think placement of the banana could of been better. &lt;?&gt;</td>', 'Lovely shot. I like the light and the soft focus. I think placement of the banana could of been better. <?>', '2004-05-24 16:06:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(733896, 78605, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting of a mundane subject. Don''t quite care for the central placement of the open banana.</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting of a mundane subject. Don''t quite care for the central placement of the open banana.', '2004-05-24 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(733907, 78685, 7322, '<td valign="top">At first I thought that white splotch on the boy''s shirt was overly bright lighting. I think if he were wearing a simpler shirt this would have worked better as the white is very distracting.The background should have been blurred.   I have a strong bias against this Photoshop effect. The boy is appealing, though.</td>', 'At first I thought that white splotch on the boy''s shirt was overly bright lighting. I think if he were wearing a simpler shirt this would have worked better as the white is very distracting.The background should have been blurred.   I have a strong bias against this Photoshop effect. The boy is appealing, though.', '2004-05-24 16:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(733912, 78558, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting. It''s a very fake looking set-up though. It looks like what it is....someone holding bananas up to the sky. It looks more like an offering than a gift.</td>', 'Nice color and lighting. It''s a very fake looking set-up though. It looks like what it is....someone holding bananas up to the sky. It looks more like an offering than a gift.', '2004-05-24 16:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(733920, 78510, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the motion blur is necessary for this idea. It''s too much of a good thing. There is a bit too much glare on the monitor. I find it a very mundane shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure the motion blur is necessary for this idea. It''s too much of a good thing. There is a bit too much glare on the monitor. I find it a very mundane shot.', '2004-05-24 16:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(733927, 78416, 14614, '<td valign="top">really like your use of blue to set off the yellow subject.  interesting composition (would like a bit more room above the subject''s head) One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'really like your use of blue to set off the yellow subject.  interesting composition (would like a bit more room above the subject''s head) One of my ribbon picks.', '2004-05-24 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(733929, 78446, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and intersting composition... one of  my ribbon picks</td>', 'excellent lighting and intersting composition... one of  my ribbon picks', '2004-05-24 16:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(733931, 78739, 14614, '<td valign="top">unique take onthe theme -- one of my top picks</td>', 'unique take onthe theme -- one of my top picks', '2004-05-24 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(733932, 78654, 14614, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract composition -- one of my top picks</td>', 'interesting abstract composition -- one of my top picks', '2004-05-24 16:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(733934, 78575, 14614, '<td valign="top">very creative, well exposed, one of my top picks this challenge</td>', 'very creative, well exposed, one of my top picks this challenge', '2004-05-24 16:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(733937, 78658, 21310, '<td valign="top">Yummy.  I love the DOF, crisp focus.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Yummy.  I love the DOF, crisp focus.  Excellent shot.', '2004-05-24 16:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(733938, 78417, 14614, '<td valign="top">usually not a fan of the "wooden" subject but this is extremely well done.  you''ve done a fab job with the lighting and composition.  one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'usually not a fan of the "wooden" subject but this is extremely well done.  you''ve done a fab job with the lighting and composition.  one of my favorites this challenge', '2004-05-24 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(733940, 78739, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would have been more successful if the bananas were not obscuring the lower half of hs face. I know you want the focus to be on his eyes but I think the bananas and his hand are a little too blurry. Could a happy medium be achieved where the sharpest details are in his face without losing all the detail in the bananas?  The lighting is great and the subject appealing. There is a bit to much purple cast to the grays.</td>', 'This would have been more successful if the bananas were not obscuring the lower half of hs face. I know you want the focus to be on his eyes but I think the bananas and his hand are a little too blurry. Could a happy medium be achieved where the sharpest details are in his face without losing all the detail in the bananas?  The lighting is great and the subject appealing. There is a bit to much purple cast to the grays.', '2004-05-24 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(733942, 78865, 14614, '<td valign="top">nicely done still life</td>', 'nicely done still life', '2004-05-24 16:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(733944, 78818, 7322, '<td valign="top">The composition is pleasing as an abstract. The lighting is a bit flat. I don''t like the white and black borders.</td>', 'The composition is pleasing as an abstract. The lighting is a bit flat. I don''t like the white and black borders.', '2004-05-24 16:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(733946, 78909, 14614, '<td valign="top">well composed -- a creative take on the theme this time -- one of my favorites</td>', 'well composed -- a creative take on the theme this time -- one of my favorites', '2004-05-24 16:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(733949, 78500, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very good composition and the subject is appealing in a humorous way. The cleverness works outside the boundaries of this challenge.</td>', 'Very good composition and the subject is appealing in a humorous way. The cleverness works outside the boundaries of this challenge.', '2004-05-24 16:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(733950, 78647, 14614, '<td valign="top">the dirty yellow color really works for me -- your use of negative space gives this an edge.  One of my ribbon picks this challange</td>', 'the dirty yellow color really works for me -- your use of negative space gives this an edge.  One of my ribbon picks this challange', '2004-05-24 16:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(733951, 78856, 17033, '<td valign="top">Brilliantly incongrous!</td>', 'Brilliantly incongrous!', '2004-05-24 16:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(733959, 78872, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting lacks drama for this set-up. There is an overall flat quality to the image. To imrove this, have your model stand a bit further away and use a supplemental light aimed at the background. Move it around untill you get a pleasing shadow on the background. This separates the subject from the background. There is a bit to much blue cast.  <br/> <br/> As a set-up it works pretty well. The top of the banana is a bit out of focus, or perhaps there just isn''t enough contrast between the background and the edge of the banana.</td>', 'The lighting lacks drama for this set-up. There is an overall flat quality to the image. To imrove this, have your model stand a bit further away and use a supplemental light aimed at the background. Move it around untill you get a pleasing shadow on the background. This separates the subject from the background. There is a bit to much blue cast.    As a set-up it works pretty well. The top of the banana is a bit out of focus, or perhaps there just isn''t enough contrast between the background and the edge of the banana.', '2004-05-24 16:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(733965, 78515, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute but unoriginal. The lighting is flat which flattens out the forms. It''s cropped a bit to tight.</td>', 'Cute but unoriginal. The lighting is flat which flattens out the forms. It''s cropped a bit to tight.', '2004-05-24 16:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(733966, 78537, 17033, '<td valign="top">How did you do this? Did you exchange yellow for the dark shadow? Nice effect...well done.</td>', 'How did you do this? Did you exchange yellow for the dark shadow? Nice effect...well done.', '2004-05-24 16:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(733968, 78531, 7322, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit busy. There isn''t enough light on the flowers. they may as well not be in this shot. I like the light falling across the bananas. There is a bit too much blue cast.</td>', 'The background is a bit busy. There isn''t enough light on the flowers. they may as well not be in this shot. I like the light falling across the bananas. There is a bit too much blue cast.', '2004-05-24 16:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(733972, 78782, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sharper focus on the chimp''s eyes would have raised this from a nice snap shot with an appealing subject to a dramatic portrait. The background is blurred but still a bit distracting because of the contrast of the blown out ground and the dark trees.</td>', 'Sharper focus on the chimp''s eyes would have raised this from a nice snap shot with an appealing subject to a dramatic portrait. The background is blurred but still a bit distracting because of the contrast of the blown out ground and the dark trees.', '2004-05-24 16:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(733976, 78518, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of her bright blue eyes and good skin tones but it could have been cropped tighter. We don''t need to see this much of her busy outfit. The background could have been blurred a bit more. The leaves near the top of her head are in sharp focus and draw attention away from her face.</td>', 'Nice capture of her bright blue eyes and good skin tones but it could have been cropped tighter. We don''t need to see this much of her busy outfit. The background could have been blurred a bit more. The leaves near the top of her head are in sharp focus and draw attention away from her face.', '2004-05-24 16:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(733979, 78515, 17033, '<td valign="top">look up ''Arcimbolo fruit face'' on Google images!!!!</td>', 'look up ''Arcimbolo fruit face'' on Google images!!!!', '2004-05-24 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(733981, 78669, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and good color. A bit to much glare on the surface of the bear sculpture. The subject just doesn''t have enough appeal for this photo to be successful beyond the boundaries of this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting perspective and good color. A bit to much glare on the surface of the bear sculpture. The subject just doesn''t have enough appeal for this photo to be successful beyond the boundaries of this challenge.', '2004-05-24 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
