(734479, 78673, 8624, '<td valign="top">The yellow banana chips offset the bright red flower nicely.  some of the shiny chips are rather distracting though.</td>', 'The yellow banana chips offset the bright red flower nicely.  some of the shiny chips are rather distracting though.', '2004-05-24 23:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(734484, 78518, 8624, '<td valign="top">she doesn''t hear you beacuse she''s talking into the wrong end - sheesh! everybody knows that the bottom tip of the banana if the end you talk into. :)</td>', 'she doesn''t hear you beacuse she''s talking into the wrong end - sheesh! everybody knows that the bottom tip of the banana if the end you talk into. :)', '2004-05-24 23:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(734665, 78439, 7322, '<td valign="top">I think I got what you did here but it just is too unappealing with the wierdly transparent textured background and the flat lighting. The colors all look muddy and the fruit unappetizing.</td>', 'I think I got what you did here but it just is too unappealing with the wierdly transparent textured background and the flat lighting. The colors all look muddy and the fruit unappetizing.', '2004-05-25 02:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(734667, 78861, 7322, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement but the lighting is a bit flat. There is a good start with the darking the upper part of the background but it could have been a titch darker to add a little more drama to the mundane subject.</td>', 'Nice arrangement but the lighting is a bit flat. There is a good start with the darking the upper part of the background but it could have been a titch darker to add a little more drama to the mundane subject.', '2004-05-25 02:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(734673, 78727, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. You have a good start with the executiion but the banana is too out of focus. It should stand out in sharper contrast to the line of light.</td>', 'Interesting idea. You have a good start with the executiion but the banana is too out of focus. It should stand out in sharper contrast to the line of light.', '2004-05-25 02:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(734675, 78802, 9089, '<td valign="top">Just because you do the technique on purpose, does not make it into a good photo simply because of the technique.  I would have liked to see this photo without the person in it.  In other words, just because we can, doesn''t mean we should.</td>', 'Just because you do the technique on purpose, does not make it into a good photo simply because of the technique.  I would have liked to see this photo without the person in it.  In other words, just because we can, doesn''t mean we should.', '2004-05-25 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(734677, 78593, 9089, '<td valign="top">Tribute to the flying toasters photo?  Unfortunately OOF.</td>', 'Tribute to the flying toasters photo?  Unfortunately OOF.', '2004-05-25 02:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(734678, 78870, 9089, '<td valign="top">This would be really good, but one nitpick, the nose piercing does not have enough detail to make it part of the picture, and thus I''m wondering about the ''booger'' that was left on the side of the nose after a wipe, and is incongruous to the clarity and beauty of the rest of the photo.  Everything else is fantastic in the photo.</td>', 'This would be really good, but one nitpick, the nose piercing does not have enough detail to make it part of the picture, and thus I''m wondering about the ''booger'' that was left on the side of the nose after a wipe, and is incongruous to the clarity and beauty of the rest of the photo.  Everything else is fantastic in the photo.', '2004-05-25 02:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(734680, 78439, 9089, '<td valign="top">Flash sync with a 7i?  I would like to see the basket tilted a bit to the right to make it more level.</td>', 'Flash sync with a 7i?  I would like to see the basket tilted a bit to the right to make it more level.', '2004-05-25 02:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(734683, 78658, 9089, '<td valign="top">With the white color of the bananas, my eyes are drawn to the out of focus semi-red strawberries.  I would like to have seen the banana out of focus and the strawberries (flipped over to show the bright red outside) in focus.</td>', 'With the white color of the bananas, my eyes are drawn to the out of focus semi-red strawberries.  I would like to have seen the banana out of focus and the strawberries (flipped over to show the bright red outside) in focus.', '2004-05-25 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(734692, 78594, 9089, '<td valign="top">I think the text really hurts the photo and the splash effect you were trying to accomplish.</td>', 'I think the text really hurts the photo and the splash effect you were trying to accomplish.', '2004-05-25 02:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
