(735759, 78666, 20779, '<td valign="top">Looks very tempting! I like the lighting on this -- it makes it look fresh and exciting.</td>', 'Looks very tempting! I like the lighting on this -- it makes it look fresh and exciting.', '2004-05-25 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(735763, 78651, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity here, and cute title, too. Not sure if more contrast and color would add or subtract, but would be interesting to try.</td>', 'I like the simplicity here, and cute title, too. Not sure if more contrast and color would add or subtract, but would be interesting to try.', '2004-05-25 19:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(735765, 78528, 20779, '<td valign="top">The banana is in perfect focus. The little girl looks a little bit like an old photograph to me in the background. I am not sure what I am</td>', 'The banana is in perfect focus. The little girl looks a little bit like an old photograph to me in the background. I am not sure what I am', '2004-05-25 19:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(735769, 78782, 20779, '<td valign="top">Classic shot!! The banana stands out well. I would like to see a little different crop possibly, and in a perfect world, a bit sharper focus. Bot excellent shot and his expression is perfect.</td>', 'Classic shot!! The banana stands out well. I would like to see a little different crop possibly, and in a perfect world, a bit sharper focus. Bot excellent shot and his expression is perfect.', '2004-05-25 19:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(735772, 78518, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great, clear shot that really jumps out at you. It would be even more striking, possibly, with "less" going on in the picture.</td>', 'Great, clear shot that really jumps out at you. It would be even more striking, possibly, with "less" going on in the picture.', '2004-05-25 19:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(735773, 78909, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great concept and color. I might like to see it a little less centered as a composition.</td>', 'Great concept and color. I might like to see it a little less centered as a composition.', '2004-05-25 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(735775, 78594, 20779, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I thought we couldn''t use text. Must go read those rules again! What can I say -- perfect shot!!</td>', 'For some reason, I thought we couldn''t use text. Must go read those rules again! What can I say -- perfect shot!!', '2004-05-25 19:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(735779, 78493, 12328, '<td valign="top">Hehe, how come the banana didnt cave in? :D</td>', 'Hehe, how come the banana didnt cave in? :D', '2004-05-25 20:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(735780, 78575, 20779, '<td valign="top">I swear you can taste this photograph! One of my top picks! Is the heart on purpose?</td>', 'I swear you can taste this photograph! One of my top picks! Is the heart on purpose?', '2004-05-25 20:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(735781, 78856, 12328, '<td valign="top">Nice, them bananas look .... a little like small children waiting at a roadside</td>', 'Nice, them bananas look .... a little like small children waiting at a roadside', '2004-05-25 20:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(735782, 78575, 15575, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea...I like it a lot!</td>', 'Very nice idea...I like it a lot!', '2004-05-25 20:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(735783, 78594, 11518, '<td valign="top">Great stop-motion!  I love it.  The text doesn''t add anything though.  Just the banana falling in the water is better.</td>', 'Great stop-motion!  I love it.  The text doesn''t add anything though.  Just the banana falling in the water is better.', '2004-05-25 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(735784, 78865, 20235, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm, tasty! Very nice lighting and composition in this shot. This would work well as a product advertisement. The use of the white backdrop really makes the subject "pop". Nice work.</td>', 'Mmmmm, tasty! Very nice lighting and composition in this shot. This would work well as a product advertisement. The use of the white backdrop really makes the subject "pop". Nice work.', '2004-05-25 20:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(735786, 78652, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo. The lighting is a little too harsh though and causes some desaturation in the colors ie. the banana looks white. I think softer and warmer lighting would have added to the photo overall.</td>', 'Very cute photo. The lighting is a little too harsh though and causes some desaturation in the colors ie. the banana looks white. I think softer and warmer lighting would have added to the photo overall.', '2004-05-25 20:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(735787, 78633, 11518, '<td valign="top">Ahem, am I the only one reading something Freudian in that shot or do I just have a dirty mind?  LOL. Well done shot BTW.  I would have preferred a pure black background though. 7</td>', 'Ahem, am I the only one reading something Freudian in that shot or do I just have a dirty mind?  LOL. Well done shot BTW.  I would have preferred a pure black background though. 7', '2004-05-25 20:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(735789, 78697, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The b&amp;w really works well here to emphasize the subject. Color saturation on the banana is nice and deep. It looks like there are areas (on the banana) that were accidentally made b&amp;w? Otherwise, very cool shot.</td>', 'Very nice photo. The b&w really works well here to emphasize the subject. Color saturation on the banana is nice and deep. It looks like there are areas (on the banana) that were accidentally made b&w? Otherwise, very cool shot.', '2004-05-25 20:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(735790, 78812, 20235, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I think the shot would have been improved though if the shadow was not in the composition.</td>', 'Interesting photo. I think the shot would have been improved though if the shadow was not in the composition.', '2004-05-25 20:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(735791, 78511, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL, I guess he''s one un-bruised banana...;-)</td>', 'LOL, I guess he''s one un-bruised banana...;-)', '2004-05-25 20:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(735793, 78791, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and DOF.  The monochromatic colors versus the banana''s really light it up (no pun intended). Nice work.</td>', 'Nice lighting and DOF.  The monochromatic colors versus the banana''s really light it up (no pun intended). Nice work.', '2004-05-25 20:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(735794, 78647, 11518, '<td valign="top">Love it. Good lighting.  Perfect use of the negative space. 9</td>', 'Love it. Good lighting.  Perfect use of the negative space. 9', '2004-05-25 20:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(735795, 78562, 20235, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The colors look a little washed out and overly "warm". Some of the details also seem a little out of focus. Otherwise, well done.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The colors look a little washed out and overly "warm". Some of the details also seem a little out of focus. Otherwise, well done.', '2004-05-25 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(735803, 78524, 20235, '<td valign="top">NIce shot. I think if the framing was moved upwards to capture more of the bananas and less of the counter-top and bowl, the photo would have been better.</td>', 'NIce shot. I think if the framing was moved upwards to capture more of the bananas and less of the counter-top and bowl, the photo would have been better.', '2004-05-25 20:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(735804, 78727, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. The contrast and, obviously, lighting make it very nice to look at. Will be interesting to find out more about it when the challange is over.... 8</td>', 'Very cool photo. The contrast and, obviously, lighting make it very nice to look at. Will be interesting to find out more about it when the challange is over.... 8', '2004-05-25 20:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(735806, 78844, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF and soft focus. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful DOF and soft focus. Well done!', '2004-05-25 20:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(735808, 78510, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and blur effects. Maybe less reflection on the computer screen would have improved it slightly?</td>', 'Nice shot and blur effects. Maybe less reflection on the computer screen would have improved it slightly?', '2004-05-25 20:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(735809, 78454, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty composition and lighting. The shadows make for some nice effects here.</td>', 'Very pretty composition and lighting. The shadows make for some nice effects here.', '2004-05-25 20:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(735816, 78535, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good lines in this photo. Would have been better if the flash did not leave bright spots on the subject.</td>', 'Good lines in this photo. Would have been better if the flash did not leave bright spots on the subject.', '2004-05-25 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(735818, 78733, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I think this photo would have been improved with the use of less lighting for shadow effect or b&amp;w?</td>', 'Very nice. I think this photo would have been improved with the use of less lighting for shadow effect or b&w?', '2004-05-25 20:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(735825, 78654, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very interesting picture to look at. The banana was a challenging subject for macro because it is rather featureless and mono-tone and this makes it very difficult to take an interesting shot. However, with the use of lighting, shadows, and composition you have managed to do just that... create a very interesting and appealing photo. You''ve turned produce into art. Very well done..... 9</td>', 'Very interesting picture to look at. The banana was a challenging subject for macro because it is rather featureless and mono-tone and this makes it very difficult to take an interesting shot. However, with the use of lighting, shadows, and composition you have managed to do just that... create a very interesting and appealing photo. You''ve turned produce into art. Very well done..... 9', '2004-05-25 20:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(735827, 78518, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great colors and DOF... very amusing photo :)</td>', 'Great colors and DOF... very amusing photo :)', '2004-05-25 20:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(735829, 78415, 20235, '<td valign="top">Simple, but interesting nonetheless. I think tweaking the lighting to remove the glare on the right and shadows cast by the banana would have improved it.</td>', 'Simple, but interesting nonetheless. I think tweaking the lighting to remove the glare on the right and shadows cast by the banana would have improved it.', '2004-05-25 20:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(735831, 78789, 20235, '<td valign="top">Hehe, very funny picture. Great color saturation on the banana.</td>', 'Hehe, very funny picture. Great color saturation on the banana.', '2004-05-25 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(735836, 78867, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good contrasts here in color and texture. The background (tools) looks a little dark, but I think that works well here to emphasize the subject.</td>', 'Good contrasts here in color and texture. The background (tools) looks a little dark, but I think that works well here to emphasize the subject.', '2004-05-25 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(735841, 78447, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Very creative idea!</td>', 'Nice photo. Very creative idea!', '2004-05-25 20:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(735843, 78720, 20235, '<td valign="top">Probably the most interesting one I''ve seen so far. Technically, this looks like a very difficult shot to produce. The lighting, composition, detail, and colors are all great..... 8</td>', 'Probably the most interesting one I''ve seen so far. Technically, this looks like a very difficult shot to produce. The lighting, composition, detail, and colors are all great..... 8', '2004-05-25 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(735860, 78564, 7703, '<td valign="top">This is a good one.</td>', 'This is a good one.', '2004-05-25 21:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
