(736480, 78662, 16266, '<td valign="top">great idea, not as good execution.  window light would have been much better than the bulb, or flourescent or flash you used, and a background that was unrecognizable... like a sheet far away, or a white paper, or black paper, or anything... the blanket doesn''t really add.. or well.. it detracts.</td>', 'great idea, not as good execution.  window light would have been much better than the bulb, or flourescent or flash you used, and a background that was unrecognizable... like a sheet far away, or a white paper, or black paper, or anything... the blanket doesn''t really add.. or well.. it detracts.', '2004-05-26 02:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(736579, 78679, 5792, '<td valign="top">Intersting because the bananas look worn out. The black and white fringe on the top of the still life looks like you made a background replacements that did not merge well. The fringe is distracting to the image and can be easily removed by slecting the background only and cloning it out.</td>', 'Intersting because the bananas look worn out. The black and white fringe on the top of the still life looks like you made a background replacements that did not merge well. The fringe is distracting to the image and can be easily removed by slecting the background only and cloning it out.', '2004-05-26 03:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
