(739085, 78446, 19952, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and a nice shot overall. A little soft and has some grain in the shadows, but you did a really good job.</td>', 'Interesting angle and a nice shot overall. A little soft and has some grain in the shadows, but you did a really good job.', '2004-05-27 10:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(739090, 78519, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very funny! One of the best photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Very funny! One of the best photos in this challenge.', '2004-05-27 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(739095, 78861, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and a really good shot. It would be better with more light and brighter colors, but it''s still a good, interesting photo.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and a really good shot. It would be better with more light and brighter colors, but it''s still a good, interesting photo.', '2004-05-27 10:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(739102, 78515, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow! While I was struggling just to get a banana to prop up straight, you were assembling an entire produce department into your shot. A bit more light around the edges would have helped, but it''s just amazing what you were able to do here with such a simple challenge. Nice job!</td>', 'Wow! While I was struggling just to get a banana to prop up straight, you were assembling an entire produce department into your shot. A bit more light around the edges would have helped, but it''s just amazing what you were able to do here with such a simple challenge. Nice job!', '2004-05-27 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(739103, 78466, 5391, '<td valign="top">Positively gorgeous abstract.  Looks like an old world painting.  10</td>', 'Positively gorgeous abstract.  Looks like an old world painting.  10', '2004-05-27 11:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(739106, 78739, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very creative portrait, nicely done.  The tonal range is beautiful.  9</td>', 'Very creative portrait, nicely done.  The tonal range is beautiful.  9', '2004-05-27 11:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(739108, 78466, 19952, '<td valign="top">This was a really nice and unique idea for this challenge. I think the blurring is a bit excessive for this shot since there''s no real action to accompany it, but it still came out pretty well. Good job!</td>', 'This was a really nice and unique idea for this challenge. I think the blurring is a bit excessive for this shot since there''s no real action to accompany it, but it still came out pretty well. Good job!', '2004-05-27 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(739122, 78673, 19952, '<td valign="top">First of all, hilarious title. :-) I wish this shot were a little more clear since such shiny banana slices don''t seem to do well in soft focus. But the colors are amazing and the idea for this shot was really nice. Good job.</td>', 'First of all, hilarious title. :-) I wish this shot were a little more clear since such shiny banana slices don''t seem to do well in soft focus. But the colors are amazing and the idea for this shot was really nice. Good job.', '2004-05-27 11:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(739145, 78483, 6130, '<td valign="top">So natural and good.10</td>', 'So natural and good.10', '2004-05-27 11:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(739273, 78537, 19816, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo..I think your lighting was just a little to bright Your banana almost blends with your background.Good Luck</td>', 'Very nice photo..I think your lighting was just a little to bright Your banana almost blends with your background.Good Luck', '2004-05-27 13:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(739278, 78466, 20786, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this I didn''t like it much at all...too blurry, blah, blah, blah...but it keeps catching my eye, and I find that every time I look at it again it jumps up a point. The more I look at it I see more of a painting quality to it. good job...</td>', 'When I first saw this I didn''t like it much at all...too blurry, blah, blah, blah...but it keeps catching my eye, and I find that every time I look at it again it jumps up a point. The more I look at it I see more of a painting quality to it. good job...', '2004-05-27 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(739304, 78600, 7703, '<td valign="top">Bad quality on this one. You should also try to crop the image difrent.</td>', 'Bad quality on this one. You should also try to crop the image difrent.', '2004-05-27 13:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(739306, 78844, 7703, '<td valign="top">What can I say? Perfect</td>', 'What can I say? Perfect', '2004-05-27 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(739318, 78633, 7703, '<td valign="top">This mouth does not look like it is gona eat the banana so the title is not the right one :P You should also try to fix this white thing in the top right corner. Other then that I like it :)</td>', 'This mouth does not look like it is gona eat the banana so the title is not the right one :P You should also try to fix this white thing in the top right corner. Other then that I like it :)', '2004-05-27 13:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
