(739328, 78685, 7703, '<td valign="top">Like this BW/color thing but how you took it is not working for me. What you should try is not to have the subject in the middle but to the tight or left ... I think left in this case.  Let the boy look to the right (always into the image) and crop of the top of the head and bottom of the image ... :P yes try this :)</td>', 'Like this BW/color thing but how you took it is not working for me. What you should try is not to have the subject in the middle but to the tight or left ... I think left in this case.  Let the boy look to the right (always into the image) and crop of the top of the head and bottom of the image ... :P yes try this :)', '2004-05-27 13:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(739330, 78679, 7703, '<td valign="top">The banana is not the main subject here and I had to look for them. Try to keep the subject more as the main subject. The shaddow under the bowl is not good. :P Sorry bad english.</td>', 'The banana is not the main subject here and I had to look for them. Try to keep the subject more as the main subject. The shaddow under the bowl is not good. :P Sorry bad english.', '2004-05-27 13:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
