(739440, 78593, 19816, '<td valign="top">Great idea but i think it could have been more crisp.I think that would have made that photo a beautiful shot.I like the picture just wish it was clearer.</td>', 'Great idea but i think it could have been more crisp.I think that would have made that photo a beautiful shot.I like the picture just wish it was clearer.', '2004-05-27 15:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
