(739514, 78733, 2612, '<td valign="top">It made me smile, which will help the score.<br/> <br/>The lighting appears to come straight from the front, which isn''t complentary for the model or the banana. Some more dramatic lighting might have helped! Maybe some soft if the relation between these friends is more than casual.</td>', 'It made me smile, which will help the score. The lighting appears to come straight from the front, which isn''t complentary for the model or the banana. Some more dramatic lighting might have helped! Maybe some soft if the relation between these friends is more than casual.', '2004-05-27 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(739837, 78802, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Watch out - there''s a ribbon in your future.</td>', 'Very well done.  Watch out - there''s a ribbon in your future.', '2004-05-27 19:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(739838, 78692, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional portrait.  Standby for a ribbon heading your way.</td>', 'Exceptional portrait.  Standby for a ribbon heading your way.', '2004-05-27 19:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(739840, 78654, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of the most original entries of the "bunch."  While not exactly Antelope Canyon - it does have that feel to it.  May have been even better if your bananas didn''t have the ripening spots.  Well well thought out, composed and shot.</td>', 'One of the most original entries of the "bunch."  While not exactly Antelope Canyon - it does have that feel to it.  May have been even better if your bananas didn''t have the ripening spots.  Well well thought out, composed and shot.', '2004-05-27 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(739842, 78642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Original idea!  That''s sure a lot of bananas to eat up!.  Nice exposure and composition.</td>', 'Original idea!  That''s sure a lot of bananas to eat up!.  Nice exposure and composition.', '2004-05-27 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(739846, 78518, 19608, '<td valign="top">A few people came up with the same idea - but yours is far above the pack.  Your models expression is quite dramatic.  Taken in great lighting.  Background is generally ok, but the bright green/yellow spots above the model''s head have to go bye bye.  Should score very high.</td>', 'A few people came up with the same idea - but yours is far above the pack.  Your models expression is quite dramatic.  Taken in great lighting.  Background is generally ok, but the bright green/yellow spots above the model''s head have to go bye bye.  Should score very high.', '2004-05-27 19:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(739847, 78575, 19608, '<td valign="top">VERY ORIGINAL idea!  Nicely arranged and composed.  May be a bit underexposed but not enough to subtract anything.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'VERY ORIGINAL idea!  Nicely arranged and composed.  May be a bit underexposed but not enough to subtract anything.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-05-27 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(739849, 78513, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - it has a banana or two - but after that - it''s very difficult to read.  You need to show more of the dog.</td>', 'Well - it has a banana or two - but after that - it''s very difficult to read.  You need to show more of the dog.', '2004-05-27 20:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
