(740981, 78673, 12962, '<td valign="top">I keep on going back to this.  I am sure people will find fault that this is not banancentric but the challenge says as long as there is a banana in the picture ... so surely this one fits.  I love color contrast, the off centering of the rose and the brilliant red color of the rose.  I just wish you didn''t cut the petal so close at the bottom, but I am just being petty.  DOF is also great.  I don''t know what else to say but I hope you finish in the top ten, or top twenty at least.</td>', 'I keep on going back to this.  I am sure people will find fault that this is not banancentric but the challenge says as long as there is a banana in the picture ... so surely this one fits.  I love color contrast, the off centering of the rose and the brilliant red color of the rose.  I just wish you didn''t cut the petal so close at the bottom, but I am just being petty.  DOF is also great.  I don''t know what else to say but I hope you finish in the top ten, or top twenty at least.', '2004-05-28 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(741098, 78648, 11895, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way the banana is so close in color to the background, it loses definition, otherwise a very nice photo that fits the topic well</td>', 'I don''t like the way the banana is so close in color to the background, it loses definition, otherwise a very nice photo that fits the topic well', '2004-05-28 19:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(741107, 78515, 11895, '<td valign="top">very creative and certainly fits the topic well, since this is advanced rules you could have cloned out the seam line in the pink paper which would have improvedthis a bit, also maybe a little more contrast</td>', 'very creative and certainly fits the topic well, since this is advanced rules you could have cloned out the seam line in the pink paper which would have improvedthis a bit, also maybe a little more contrast', '2004-05-28 19:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
