(741118, 78902, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice image that fits the topic well but since this is advanced you could have cleaned it up a bit with clone tool, removing the white spots in her hair and the one on the bananas; also if you could have shown the top of her head without it being to bright at the top it would have been just a little better</td>', 'very nice image that fits the topic well but since this is advanced you could have cleaned it up a bit with clone tool, removing the white spots in her hair and the one on the bananas; also if you could have shown the top of her head without it being to bright at the top it would have been just a little better', '2004-05-28 19:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(741128, 78454, 11895, '<td valign="top">this pic is well done but it''s hard for me to think of B&amp;W as appropriate for this challenge, color would have scored at least one point higher with me</td>', 'this pic is well done but it''s hard for me to think of B&W as appropriate for this challenge, color would have scored at least one point higher with me', '2004-05-28 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(741131, 78524, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am going to Dairy Quenn for lunch after seeing that shot  :)<br/> <br/>Great food photo that really makes the food  look deliciuos.</td>', 'I am going to Dairy Quenn for lunch after seeing that shot  :) Great food photo that really makes the food  look deliciuos.', '2004-05-28 20:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(741134, 78663, 10818, '<td valign="top">How clever, and a really good shot.  Not sure I like the carpet background, but well done none the less.</td>', 'How clever, and a really good shot.  Not sure I like the carpet background, but well done none the less.', '2004-05-28 20:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(741137, 78564, 10818, '<td valign="top">WOW, that is too cool.  What a very clever and terrific photo.<br/> <br/>Well done.  10</td>', 'WOW, that is too cool.  What a very clever and terrific photo. Well done.  10', '2004-05-28 20:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(741381, 78506, 19608, '<td valign="top">The blue makes a great backdrop for the banana slices.  You have good depth of field and exposure but unfortunately it doesn''t have anything to really grab the viewer.</td>', 'The blue makes a great backdrop for the banana slices.  You have good depth of field and exposure but unfortunately it doesn''t have anything to really grab the viewer.', '2004-05-29 01:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(741387, 78652, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice expusure on the critters - but the banana seems a bit hot.  Good ocus - nice textures.  Compositionally - it''s like 2 images, the eye bounibg back and forth between the 2 critters.</td>', 'Nice expusure on the critters - but the banana seems a bit hot.  Good ocus - nice textures.  Compositionally - it''s like 2 images, the eye bounibg back and forth between the 2 critters.', '2004-05-29 01:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(741396, 78879, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot.  Bird well exposed and in perfect focus.  I know the challenge was banana but think you could easily say the same thing with about 1/2 of the banana you show.  As is - it''s pretty huge area of just yellow space.</td>', 'Good macro shot.  Bird well exposed and in perfect focus.  I know the challenge was banana but think you could easily say the same thing with about 1/2 of the banana you show.  As is - it''s pretty huge area of just yellow space.', '2004-05-29 01:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(741398, 78651, 19608, '<td valign="top">No - threes are NEXT week!  Nice idea, exposure and focus.  Not a great amonut to hold interest.</td>', 'No - threes are NEXT week!  Nice idea, exposure and focus.  Not a great amonut to hold interest.', '2004-05-29 01:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(741401, 78663, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea!  But maybe it''s taking several small bananas abd merging them into one large one!  Exposure and focus right on.  May work a bit better in more of a diagonal composition.</td>', 'A very clever idea!  But maybe it''s taking several small bananas abd merging them into one large one!  Exposure and focus right on.  May work a bit better in more of a diagonal composition.', '2004-05-29 02:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(741402, 78421, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cruelty to animals - lookout for the SPCA!  Nice idea, good exposure.  Model doesn''t seem totally thrilled.  Ttle says it all.</td>', 'Cruelty to animals - lookout for the SPCA!  Nice idea, good exposure.  Model doesn''t seem totally thrilled.  Ttle says it all.', '2004-05-29 02:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(741405, 78782, 19608, '<td valign="top">I thought there would be a pile of these - but you are a lone entrant!  Good capture - too bad the critter doesn''t seem to have much interest in what''s going on.</td>', 'I thought there would be a pile of these - but you are a lone entrant!  Good capture - too bad the critter doesn''t seem to have much interest in what''s going on.', '2004-05-29 02:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(741407, 78727, 19608, '<td valign="top">Far out.  Black background makes the colors really pop.  Your trace light could have used a steadier hand.</td>', 'Far out.  Black background makes the colors really pop.  Your trace light could have used a steadier hand.', '2004-05-29 02:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(741408, 78519, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure, composition used for a clever idea.  Original!</td>', 'Excellent exposure, composition used for a clever idea.  Original!', '2004-05-29 02:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(741413, 78739, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a GREAT portrait of a very expressive face.  Your lightinhg technique is near perfect with half the face in soft light and the other half in minor shadow.  The sepia printing is perfect for the subject.  Having said all that,  I hope you took the same exact shot WITHOUT the bananas.  They are so very distracting with the placement and the OOF.  It just didn''t work for you.</td>', 'You have a GREAT portrait of a very expressive face.  Your lightinhg technique is near perfect with half the face in soft light and the other half in minor shadow.  The sepia printing is perfect for the subject.  Having said all that,  I hope you took the same exact shot WITHOUT the bananas.  They are so very distracting with the placement and the OOF.  It just didn''t work for you.', '2004-05-29 02:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(741414, 78493, 19608, '<td valign="top">Original!  How do you tell the sex of a banana anyway?  Perfect expoyre - would proably work better on a dark backgrould without the wood grain.</td>', 'Original!  How do you tell the sex of a banana anyway?  Perfect expoyre - would proably work better on a dark backgrould without the wood grain.', '2004-05-29 02:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(741419, 78902, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very "formal" portrait.  Nice exposure - especially on the face.  Your challenge idea an interesting one.  The bright highlights on the hair need to go bye bye.</td>', 'A very "formal" portrait.  Nice exposure - especially on the face.  Your challenge idea an interesting one.  The bright highlights on the hair need to go bye bye.', '2004-05-29 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(741423, 78716, 19608, '<td valign="top">I guess I must not know about that trick - years ago it was a potato.  Of all the bananas in the challenge yours is one of the few that looks to be in good shape - no spots.  Nice exposure but not much real interest.</td>', 'I guess I must not know about that trick - years ago it was a potato.  Of all the bananas in the challenge yours is one of the few that looks to be in good shape - no spots.  Nice exposure but not much real interest.', '2004-05-29 02:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(741431, 78487, 19608, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a special moment.  Nice flat lighting lends to great portraits.  The red shoes and earring add real zest.  The girl on the left feels a litttle "left out" somehow.</td>', 'You''ve captured a special moment.  Nice flat lighting lends to great portraits.  The red shoes and earring add real zest.  The girl on the left feels a litttle "left out" somehow.', '2004-05-29 02:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
