(741594, 78575, 8005, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. I am giving you a 10. The message is very subtle. Great job. Great focus. I think you might be getting my only 10.</td>', 'I really like this picture. I am giving you a 10. The message is very subtle. Great job. Great focus. I think you might be getting my only 10.', '2004-05-29 08:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
