(741768, 78791, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever stuff! Your lighting, as usual, is interesting and effective, and your exposure just perfect. Interesting idea and great execution. 9</td>', 'Clever stuff! Your lighting, as usual, is interesting and effective, and your exposure just perfect. Interesting idea and great execution. 9', '2004-05-29 14:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(741771, 78654, 6870, '<td valign="top">Great allusion (and illusion)! I love the effect! 10</td>', 'Great allusion (and illusion)! I love the effect! 10', '2004-05-29 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(741773, 78804, 6870, '<td valign="top">I bet this was fun to make! I love the idea, and your point of view is good, too. It might be worth it to try adding light, or simply taking this outside on a bright day (but in the shade) to get it brighter but also retain the nice shadow work you''ve got here.</td>', 'I bet this was fun to make! I love the idea, and your point of view is good, too. It might be worth it to try adding light, or simply taking this outside on a bright day (but in the shade) to get it brighter but also retain the nice shadow work you''ve got here.', '2004-05-29 14:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(741778, 78652, 6870, '<td valign="top">These are cute little creatures! I like the point of view--it looks a lot like one of my old photos (except I have licorice in the middle of humans). You might simply try taking this shot outside on a bright day (but in full shade) to get it a bit brighter and to avoid harsh highlights and shadows. If you want a dark background, if often helps to move the black cloth as far away from the camera as possible, and then tilt it in such a way so that it won''t reflect any light. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'These are cute little creatures! I like the point of view--it looks a lot like one of my old photos (except I have licorice in the middle of humans). You might simply try taking this shot outside on a bright day (but in full shade) to get it a bit brighter and to avoid harsh highlights and shadows. If you want a dark background, if often helps to move the black cloth as far away from the camera as possible, and then tilt it in such a way so that it won''t reflect any light. Keep up the good work!', '2004-05-29 14:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(741779, 78564, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly done, and good point of view!</td>', 'Very cleverly done, and good point of view!', '2004-05-29 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(741780, 78528, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun point of view. She''s a cutie! I kinda wish she were in focus, too, but  having the banana in focus, certainly puts the primary focus on it as the main subject.</td>', 'Fun point of view. She''s a cutie! I kinda wish she were in focus, too, but  having the banana in focus, certainly puts the primary focus on it as the main subject.', '2004-05-29 14:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(741843, 78531, 342, '<td valign="top">i think i really would have liked this picture if you had kept the bananas yellow and evrything else black and white</td>', 'i think i really would have liked this picture if you had kept the bananas yellow and evrything else black and white', '2004-05-29 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(741895, 78837, 7560, '<td valign="top">Love the stark graphic simplicity of this image. The matching blues of sticker and background are also nice.  9</td>', 'Love the stark graphic simplicity of this image. The matching blues of sticker and background are also nice.  9', '2004-05-29 17:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(741896, 78720, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great visual effect! Like the composition and the execution. 9</td>', 'Great visual effect! Like the composition and the execution. 9', '2004-05-29 17:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(741897, 78856, 7560, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for well done running water shots. The selective desaturation works nicely. The nanners seem a bit out of place, but I still like the overall image. 9</td>', 'I''m a sucker for well done running water shots. The selective desaturation works nicely. The nanners seem a bit out of place, but I still like the overall image. 9', '2004-05-29 17:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(741899, 78417, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting choices here. This is a great presentation of a common subject. I might have considered using a more neutral background. The slats are a bit distracting. 7</td>', 'I really like the lighting choices here. This is a great presentation of a common subject. I might have considered using a more neutral background. The slats are a bit distracting. 7', '2004-05-29 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(741901, 78739, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! I like the thoughtful look on the subject. Great choice of color on the image as well. Nice bokeh. 8</td>', 'Great portrait! I like the thoughtful look on the subject. Great choice of color on the image as well. Nice bokeh. 8', '2004-05-29 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(741904, 78510, 7560, '<td valign="top">I know this feeling well! Nice idea, well executed. I''d see about using something to reduce the glare on the computer screen. That would help give the image a bit more pop. Try playing around with polarizers and possibly tape a piece of cloth or tissue paper over the light source. 7</td>', 'I know this feeling well! Nice idea, well executed. I''d see about using something to reduce the glare on the computer screen. That would help give the image a bit more pop. Try playing around with polarizers and possibly tape a piece of cloth or tissue paper over the light source. 7', '2004-05-29 18:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(741906, 78573, 7560, '<td valign="top">A classic idea well executed. I like  the use of the striped background to offset the color of the banana. Good angle on the "slip". 8</td>', 'A classic idea well executed. I like  the use of the striped background to offset the color of the banana. Good angle on the "slip". 8', '2004-05-29 18:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(741909, 78575, 7560, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro! I like the subtle way you brought the message across. Took me a second look. Simply executed, nice texture on the nanner. 8</td>', 'Excellent macro! I like the subtle way you brought the message across. Took me a second look. Simply executed, nice texture on the nanner. 8', '2004-05-29 18:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(741918, 78633, 7560, '<td valign="top">Simple composition, but comes across powerfully.  I''d do a tiny bit of cloning of the tip of the nanner to keep the small bits from distracting from the black background. 8</td>', 'Simple composition, but comes across powerfully.  I''d do a tiny bit of cloning of the tip of the nanner to keep the small bits from distracting from the black background. 8', '2004-05-29 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
