(742393, 78497, 18505, '<td valign="top">What a cute shot!!  I laughed when I first ran through the pictures, and unfortunately did not have time to comment on any of the submissions during the challenge.  I understand you had some young creative assistants on this (who certainly deserve some bravos as well!!)  This reminds me of when my daughters were young - good memories.  I hope you always keep this and remember the fun you had putting it together.  Do you think "Banana Barbie" might be a fun title too?  Thank you for the smiles!!</td>', 'What a cute shot!!  I laughed when I first ran through the pictures, and unfortunately did not have time to comment on any of the submissions during the challenge.  I understand you had some young creative assistants on this (who certainly deserve some bravos as well!!)  This reminds me of when my daughters were young - good memories.  I hope you always keep this and remember the fun you had putting it together.  Do you think "Banana Barbie" might be a fun title too?  Thank you for the smiles!!', '2004-05-30 10:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
