(742605, 78466, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>First thoughts on this was is that a wilting dandelion?  Then at second glance the bananas become obvious.  I think that the slow shutter speed you used to create such blurring was just too much.  I would have liked to have seen some movement in it but also been able to clearly make out a banana.</td>', 'Critique Club First thoughts on this was is that a wilting dandelion?  Then at second glance the bananas become obvious.  I think that the slow shutter speed you used to create such blurring was just too much.  I would have liked to have seen some movement in it but also been able to clearly make out a banana.', '2004-05-30 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
