(745069, 78900, 6968, '<td valign="top">I really liked it, it is simple and has a lot more character than most of the banana shots, face it bright yellow bananas have been done and done and done, This looks like bananas at my place :)<br/>But I agree it could have been bigger though.<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/> <br/>cl3ft</td>', 'I really liked it, it is simple and has a lot more character than most of the banana shots, face it bright yellow bananas have been done and done and done, This looks like bananas at my place :)But I agree it could have been bigger though. Cheers cl3ft', '2004-06-01 05:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
