(1693181, 78569, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a great capture. I love the expression and the composition! They are both perfect! The eyes on the banana do take a bit away from the candid shot (IMHO, I would try cloning them out?) I would also see if desaturating or darkening the background colors (the oranges) might increase the focus on the adorable face! A picture to cherish!<br/></td>', 'What a great capture. I love the expression and the composition! They are both perfect! The eyes on the banana do take a bit away from the candid shot (IMHO, I would try cloning them out?) I would also see if desaturating or darkening the background colors (the oranges) might increase the focus on the adorable face! A picture to cherish!', '2005-09-10 15:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
